{"seq":2,"slug":"photovoltaic-materials","title":"光伏材料（Photovoltaic Materials）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/photovoltaic-materials","wordCount":3022,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"光伏材料-photovoltaic-materials\">光伏材料（Photovoltaic Materials）</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>光伏（Photovoltaic, PV）技术将太阳光能直接转换为电能，是实现碳中和目标的关键路径。光伏材料的核心任务是高效吸收太阳光并将光生载流子有效分离收集。从第一代晶硅电池到第三代钙钛矿/叠层电池，光伏材料化学的每一次突破都推动着效率纪录和度电成本的刷新。</p>\n<p>截至2026年，全球光伏累计装机已超过2 TW，晶硅电池占据约95%市场份额。但以钙钛矿为代表的新型光伏材料正在加速追赶，2025-2026年单结钙钛矿效率已突破27%，钙钛矿/硅叠层效率接近35%，正式进入产业化前夜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光伏材料化学的核心命题是：<strong>高效吸收太阳光，并把光生载流子高效分离与收集</strong>。整个链条可拆成三个必须同时满足的判据，任一环节短板都会限制效率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吸收（能不能吸收）</strong>：光子能量必须 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu \\geq E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。带隙太小→低能光子浪费；带隙太大→高能光子热弛豫损失。因此存在最优带隙（1.1-1.4 eV，对应 Shockley-Queisser 极限 ~33%）。</li>\n<li><strong>分离（能不能分开）</strong>：光生电子-空穴对必须被内建电场（pn 结）或异质结界面有效分离，否则复合。载流子扩散长度必须大于吸收深度。</li>\n<li><strong>收集（能不能收走）</strong>：电极必须高效提取载流子并将复合损失降到最低，这依赖钝化技术降低表面复合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>贯穿全篇的主线是 <strong>「逼近并突破 S-Q 极限」</strong>：单结电池的理论天花板由带隙决定，突破方式只有两条——用叠层把不同带隙材料堆叠以覆盖更宽光谱（钙钛矿/硅叠层 34.85%），或改变载流子热化动力学（热载流子、多激子、中间带）。一个常见误解是认为「效率最高的材料就是最好的光伏材料」：材料还必须满足稳定性、丰度、毒性、可大面积制备等约束——这正是 CdTe（Te 稀缺）、钙钛矿（稳定性与铅毒性）面临真实产业化的核心障碍，也是晶硅至今占据 ~95% 市场的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[光伏效率] --&gt; A[光吸收&lt;br/&gt;hν ≥ Eg]&#10;  P --&gt; S[载流子分离&lt;br/&gt;内建电场/异质结]&#10;  P --&gt; C[载流子收集&lt;br/&gt;钝化降低复合]&#10;  A --&gt; L[S-Q极限 ~33%&lt;br/&gt;最优带隙 1.1-1.4 eV]&#10;  L --&gt; B1[突破策略: 叠层&lt;br/&gt;钙钛矿/硅 34.85%]&#10;  L --&gt; B2[热载流子/中间带/多激子]&#10;  S --&gt; M1[晶硅 PERC→TOPCon→HJT→BC]&#10;  C --&gt; M2[钝化: SiO2/SiNx/Al2O3/a-Si:H]&#10;  M1 --&gt; R[稳定性/丰度/毒性/大面积 约束]&#10;  B1 --&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n  P[光伏效率] --&gt; A[光吸收&lt;br/&gt;hν ≥ Eg]\n  P --&gt; S[载流子分离&lt;br/&gt;内建电场/异质结]\n  P --&gt; C[载流子收集&lt;br/&gt;钝化降低复合]\n  A --&gt; L[S-Q极限 ~33%&lt;br/&gt;最优带隙 1.1-1.4 eV]\n  L --&gt; B1[突破策略: 叠层&lt;br/&gt;钙钛矿/硅 34.85%]\n  L --&gt; B2[热载流子/中间带/多激子]\n  S --&gt; M1[晶硅 PERC→TOPCon→HJT→BC]\n  C --&gt; M2[钝化: SiO2/SiNx/Al2O3/a-Si:H]\n  M1 --&gt; R[稳定性/丰度/毒性/大面积 约束]\n  B1 --&gt; R</pre><p>三代光伏材料的技术特征对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术代际</th>\n<th>代表材料</th>\n<th>实验室效率</th>\n<th>量产效率</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>关键瓶颈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一代</td>\n<td>晶硅（单晶/多晶）</td>\n<td>26.8%（IBC）</td>\n<td>25-26%</td>\n<td>成熟、稳定、丰度高</td>\n<td>逼近 S-Q 理论极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二代</td>\n<td>CdTe / CIGS 薄膜</td>\n<td>23.6%</td>\n<td>22.1%</td>\n<td>吸光系数高、柔性兼容</td>\n<td>Te/In 稀缺、毒性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三代</td>\n<td>钙钛矿单结</td>\n<td>27.87%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>效率攀升快、溶液法</td>\n<td>水氧热光稳定性、铅毒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叠层</td>\n<td>钙钛矿/硅</td>\n<td>34.85%</td>\n<td>组件调试</td>\n<td>突破 S-Q 极限</td>\n<td>大面积均匀性、工艺兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"光伏基础原理\">光伏基础原理</h2><h3 id=\"太阳能电池工作原理\">太阳能电池工作原理</h3><p>太阳能电池本质上是一个大面积pn结二极管：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>光吸收</strong>：光子能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu \\geq E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时被吸收，激发价带电子到导带，产生电子-空穴对</li>\n<li><strong>载流子分离</strong>：pn结内建电场驱动电子向n区、空穴向p区移动</li>\n<li><strong>载流子收集</strong>：电子和空穴分别被正负电极收集，产生光电流</li>\n<li><strong>光电压产生</strong>：非平衡载流子注入导致准费米能级劈裂，产生开路电压<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"效率极限\">效率极限</h3><p><strong>Shockley-Queisser极限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单结太阳能电池的理论效率上限，取决于带隙<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>最优带隙：1.1-1.4 eV → 极限效率~33%（AM1.5G光谱）</li>\n<li>损失来源：<ul>\n<li>光子能量不足未被吸收（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu &lt; E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）→~23%</li>\n<li>高能光子热弛豫（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu &gt; E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>的多余能量→热）→~33%</li>\n<li>辐射复合（不可避免）→~2%</li>\n<li>实际额外损失：非辐射复合、电阻、光学反射</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>突破S-Q极限的策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多结/叠层电池：不同带隙吸收不同波段→减少热弛豫损失</li>\n<li>热载流子电池：在载流子冷却前提取→利用高能光子</li>\n<li>中间带电池：禁带中引入允许吸收带→两步激发</li>\n<li>多激子产生（MEG）：一个高能光子产生多个电子-空穴对</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"光伏性能参数\">光伏性能参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>物理意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短路电流密度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{sc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>光生载流子最大收集速率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开路电压</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>准费米能级劈裂的度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充因子</td>\n<td>FF</td>\n<td>I-V曲线的&quot;方形度&quot;，反映串并联电阻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功率转换效率</td>\n<td>PCE</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = J_{sc} \\cdot V_{oc} \\cdot FF / P_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外量子效率</td>\n<td>EQE</td>\n<td>每个入射光子产生的电子数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"晶硅光伏材料\">晶硅光伏材料</h2><h3 id=\"晶硅电池结构演进\">晶硅电池结构演进</h3><p><strong>BSF（背表面场）电池</strong>：~20%效率天花板，已被淘汰</p>\n<ul>\n<li>p-type Si基底 + 前扩散n⁺层 + 背面Al-BSF</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PERC（钝化发射极和背接触）</strong>：2020年代主流技术</p>\n<ul>\n<li>背面增加Al₂O₃/SiNₓ钝化层→减少背面复合→效率提升1-1.5%</li>\n<li>量产效率：23-24%</li>\n<li>p-type单晶硅主导</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TOPCon（隧穿氧化层钝化接触）</strong>：当前技术代际</p>\n<ul>\n<li>超薄SiO₂（~1.5 nm）+ n⁺多晶硅层→选择性接触（电子通过、空穴阻挡）</li>\n<li>n-type单晶硅基底</li>\n<li>量产效率：25-26%</li>\n<li>理论效率极限：28.7%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HJT（异质结）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非晶硅薄层（a-Si:H）在晶硅两面提供优异钝化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &gt; 740 mV）</li>\n<li>双面对称结构，工艺步骤少（4步 vs TOPCon 12+步）</li>\n<li>量产效率：25-26%</li>\n<li>挑战：低温工艺限制（&lt;200°C）、银浆用量大</li>\n<li>IBC-HJT结合：效率潜力&gt;27%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>BC（全背电极）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有金属电极集中在背面→前面无遮挡→最大化光吸收</li>\n<li>代表：Maxeon（SunPower）IBC电池效率26.8%</li>\n<li>ABC（全背接触异质结）：隆基绿能旗舰产品</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"硅材料纯度与性能\">硅材料纯度与性能</h3><p>太阳能级硅（SoG-Si）纯度要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>6N-9N（99.9999%-99.9999999%）</li>\n<li>关键杂质控制：B &lt; 0.3 ppma, P &lt; 0.1 ppma（影响少子寿命）</li>\n<li>载流子寿命：&gt;1 ms（对应扩散长度&gt;0.5 mm）</li>\n<li>N-type vs P-type：N-type无光致衰减（无B-O复合体），少子寿命更高</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"钝化技术\">钝化技术</h3><p>表面复合是限制效率的关键因素。钝化层的目标是同时降低界面态密度（化学钝化）和减少一种载流子到达表面的浓度（场效应钝化）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SiO₂</strong>：最经典钝化层（热氧化），Dit &lt; 10¹⁰ cm⁻²eV⁻¹</li>\n<li><strong>SiNₓ:H（PECVD）</strong>：H钝化悬挂键+正电荷场钝化→前表面标准钝化</li>\n<li><strong>Al₂O₃（ALD）</strong>：负固定电荷（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ~ -10¹³ cm⁻²）→p-type表面场钝化（PERC背面）</li>\n<li><strong>a-Si:H</strong>：优异的化学钝化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &lt; 1 fA/cm²），HJT核心钝化层</li>\n<li><strong>多晶硅/SiOₓ</strong>：TOPCon载流子选择性钝化接触</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"薄膜光伏材料\">薄膜光伏材料</h2><h3 id=\"cdte薄膜电池\">CdTe薄膜电池</h3><ul>\n<li>带隙1.45 eV（接近最优值）、高吸光系数（1 μm即可吸收&gt;99%光子）</li>\n<li>商业效率：22.1%（First Solar, NREL认证）</li>\n<li>低成本制造：近空间升华法（CSS）大面积沉积</li>\n<li>挑战：Cd毒性（需全生命周期管理）、Te稀缺</li>\n<li>改性：CdSeTe梯度合金化提升<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>和EQE</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"cigs薄膜电池\">CIGS薄膜电池</h3><p>Cu(In,Ga)Se₂四元化合物半导体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙可调：1.0-1.7 eV（Ga含量调控）</li>\n<li>实验室效率：23.6%（ZSW, NREL认证）</li>\n<li>共蒸发或溅射后硒化制备</li>\n<li>优势：柔性基底兼容、弱光性能好</li>\n<li>挑战：In稀缺、大面积均匀性控制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"钙钛矿光伏材料\">钙钛矿光伏材料</h2><h3 id=\"钙钛矿结构与性质\">钙钛矿结构与性质</h3><p>卤化物钙钛矿ABX₃（A=MA⁺/FA⁺/Cs⁺，B=Pb²⁺/Sn²⁺，X=I⁻/Br⁻/Cl⁻）：</p>\n<p><strong>优异光电性质的化学根源</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强离子性→缺陷形成能高→深能级缺陷少（&quot;缺陷容忍性&quot;）</li>\n<li>Pb 6s²孤对电子参与价带构成→价带分散度高→载流子有效质量小→高迁移率</li>\n<li>直接带隙+高吸光系数（10⁵ cm⁻¹）→300-500 nm厚即充分吸收</li>\n<li>载流子扩散长度&gt;1 μm（单晶&gt;100 μm）→载流子收集容易</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"效率发展与记录\">效率发展与记录</h3><p>钙钛矿光伏效率发展是光伏历史上最快的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>效率</th>\n<th>机构</th>\n<th>突破点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2009</td>\n<td>3.8%</td>\n<td>宫坂力（日本）</td>\n<td>首次报道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2012</td>\n<td>10.9%</td>\n<td>EPFL</td>\n<td>固态空穴层替代液态电解质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>20.1%</td>\n<td>KRICT</td>\n<td>溶剂工程、界面优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>25.5%</td>\n<td>UNIST</td>\n<td>组分工程（FA/Cs混合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>26.95%</td>\n<td>苏州大学/UNSW</td>\n<td>NREL认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026</td>\n<td>27.87%</td>\n<td>SolaEon（深圳）</td>\n<td>NPVM认证，超越硅HJT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"钙钛矿电池制备\">钙钛矿电池制备</h3><p><strong>溶液法</strong>（主流研究方法）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>旋涂前驱体溶液（PbI₂ + MAI in DMF/DMSO）</li>\n<li>反溶剂滴加（乙酸乙酯/氯苯）→快速结晶</li>\n<li>退火（100°C, 10min）→形成连续致密薄膜</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>可规模化制备方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>狭缝涂布（Slot-Die Coating）：卷对卷生产，兼容柔性基底</li>\n<li>蒸发法/共蒸发法：均匀性好，适合大面积和叠层</li>\n<li>喷涂法：材料利用率高</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"稳定性挑战\">稳定性挑战</h3><p>钙钛矿电池商业化的最大瓶颈是长期稳定性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>水分降解</strong>：MA⁺遇水分解→PbI₂ + MAI（溶解）</li>\n<li><strong>热不稳定</strong>：MAPbI₃ &gt; 85°C分解→PbI₂ + MAI(g)↑</li>\n<li><strong>光照降解</strong>：碘离子迁移、界面退化</li>\n<li><strong>离子迁移</strong>：电场驱动卤素离子移动→J-V滞后、性能衰减</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>稳定性提升策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>组分工程：FA⁺/Cs⁺替代MA⁺提高热稳定性（FAPbI₃相→α相稳定化）</li>\n<li>二维/三维混合结构：长链有机铵插入形成2D层→表面疏水</li>\n<li>添加剂钝化：PEAI（苯乙胺碘）表面处理→减少缺陷和离子迁移</li>\n<li>封装技术：边缘密封+阻水层（WVTR &lt; 10⁻⁴ g/m²/day）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"叠层电池\">叠层电池</h2><p>叠层（Tandem）电池通过堆叠不同带隙的子电池突破单结效率极限：</p>\n<h3 id=\"钙钛矿-硅叠层\">钙钛矿/硅叠层</h3><p><strong>结构</strong>：宽带隙钙钛矿顶电池（~1.7 eV）+ 硅底电池（1.12 eV）</p>\n<p><strong>效率进展</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2025年隆基：34.85%（1 cm²，NREL认证）——全球最高</li>\n<li>隆基后续报道：~35%（ESTI认证，待独立确认）</li>\n<li>天合光能：210mm钙钛矿/硅叠层组件功率超808W，进入量产线调试</li>\n<li>理论极限：~43%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>技术路线</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两端（2T）叠层：电流匹配要求严格，但工艺集成度高</li>\n<li>四端（4T）叠层：两个独立子电池，无电流匹配限制，但成本高</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>挑战</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>宽带隙钙钛矿的<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>损失（带隙-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>差距过大）</li>\n<li>大面积均匀性（从cm²到m²级别）</li>\n<li>与硅量产工艺兼容性（温度限制、织构表面沉积）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"全钙钛矿叠层\">全钙钛矿叠层</h3><ul>\n<li>宽带隙（~1.8 eV）+ 窄带隙（~1.2 eV，Sn-Pb混合钙钛矿）</li>\n<li>2025年南京大学：30.1%效率（Nature发表），全球首次突破30%</li>\n<li>优势：全溶液法、柔性兼容、成本潜力极低</li>\n<li>挑战：窄带隙Sn²⁺易氧化为Sn⁴⁺→缺陷密度高→<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>损失</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三结及以上\">三结及以上</h3><ul>\n<li>InGaP/GaAs/InGaAs：39.5%效率（聚光条件）→空间太阳能电池</li>\n<li>钙钛矿/钙钛矿/硅三结：理论效率&gt;50%，尚处于早期研究</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"光伏组件与系统\">光伏组件与系统</h2><h3 id=\"组件封装\">组件封装</h3><ul>\n<li>EVA/POE封装胶膜：保护电池片、传递机械载荷</li>\n<li>玻璃背板 vs 透明背板：双玻组件耐候性更好</li>\n<li>25年功率质保：年衰减率&lt;0.5%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"光伏度电成本-lcoe\">光伏度电成本（LCOE）</h3><ul>\n<li>2024年全球光伏LCOE已低至$0.03/kWh（最优资源地区）</li>\n<li>组件价格：&lt;$0.10/W（中国制造端）</li>\n<li>学习曲线：累计装机翻倍→成本下降~25%（Swanson定律仍在延续）</li>\n<li>钙钛矿的成本潜力：材料用量少（薄膜~500 nm）、低温加工（&lt;150°C）→有望进一步降低LCOE</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键总结\">关键总结</h2><ol>\n<li>晶硅电池从PERC→TOPCon/HJT→BC演进，量产效率从24%向27%逼近理论极限</li>\n<li>钙钛矿单结效率已达27.87%，首次超越硅异质结单结记录</li>\n<li>钙钛矿/硅叠层34.85%效率已突破硅的S-Q极限，是未来10年光伏技术主线</li>\n<li>稳定性（尤其离子迁移和水氧降解）是钙钛矿商业化的最大化学挑战</li>\n<li>光伏度电成本持续下降，已成为全球最便宜的发电方式之一</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光伏材料（Photovoltaic Materials）","id":"光伏材料-photovoltaic-materials"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"光伏基础原理","id":"光伏基础原理"},{"level":3,"text":"太阳能电池工作原理","id":"太阳能电池工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"效率极限","id":"效率极限"},{"level":3,"text":"光伏性能参数","id":"光伏性能参数"},{"level":2,"text":"晶硅光伏材料","id":"晶硅光伏材料"},{"level":3,"text":"晶硅电池结构演进","id":"晶硅电池结构演进"},{"level":3,"text":"硅材料纯度与性能","id":"硅材料纯度与性能"},{"level":3,"text":"钝化技术","id":"钝化技术"},{"level":2,"text":"薄膜光伏材料","id":"薄膜光伏材料"},{"level":3,"text":"CdTe薄膜电池","id":"cdte薄膜电池"},{"level":3,"text":"CIGS薄膜电池","id":"cigs薄膜电池"},{"level":2,"text":"钙钛矿光伏材料","id":"钙钛矿光伏材料"},{"level":3,"text":"钙钛矿结构与性质","id":"钙钛矿结构与性质"},{"level":3,"text":"效率发展与记录","id":"效率发展与记录"},{"level":3,"text":"钙钛矿电池制备","id":"钙钛矿电池制备"},{"level":3,"text":"稳定性挑战","id":"稳定性挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"叠层电池","id":"叠层电池"},{"level":3,"text":"钙钛矿/硅叠层","id":"钙钛矿-硅叠层"},{"level":3,"text":"全钙钛矿叠层","id":"全钙钛矿叠层"},{"level":3,"text":"三结及以上","id":"三结及以上"},{"level":2,"text":"光伏组件与系统","id":"光伏组件与系统"},{"level":3,"text":"组件封装","id":"组件封装"},{"level":3,"text":"光伏度电成本（LCOE）","id":"光伏度电成本-lcoe"},{"level":2,"text":"关键总结","id":"关键总结"}],"prev":{"title":"电池材料化学（Battery Materials Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/battery-materials"},"next":{"title":"氢能与燃料电池材料（Hydrogen and Fuel Cell Materials）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/hydrogen-fuel-cell"}}